Both the builder and the (home) designer can find stimulating techniques and smart solutions in exhibition houses.
It turns out that combinations of shades of black, white and gray, if they are complemented by wood tones and houseplants, can be very moody.
Good ideas can still be picked for a week, because the fair lasts until August 13.
Supplies and herb pots imply that this kitchen is often cooked.
