Gilberto Rodriguez Orejuela (Damian Alcazar) is the leader of the cartel, Miguel Rodriguez Orejuela (Francisco Denis) its brain, Pacho Herrera (Alberto Ammann) leads ties to Mexico, and Chepe Santacruz Londono (Pepe Rapazote) operates in New York.
