There was the last contact with Aare yesterday, on Friday evening, and the positioning of the phone gave the man the location of Lääne-Saare rural municipality, Mõnnuste village, where he was searched by helicopter until midnight and with dogs until early morning.
Afterwards, his phone's battery died and the man's whereabouts could therefore no longer be determined.
The police continued searching this morning.
